{"availability":"available","full":"dgesteves/agent-ui-kit","name":"agent-ui-kit","description":"Accessible React components for agent runs: tool call timelines, human-in-the-loop approvals, per-hunk diff review and run telemetry. For AI SDK 6 & 7 and AG-UI agents (LangGraph, CrewAI, Mastra).","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-06T20:37:03Z","updated":"2026-10-08T23:26:15Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://agent-ui-kit-demo.vercel.app","topics":["accessibility","ag-ui","agent-ui","ai-agents","ai-sdk","diff-viewer","generative-ui","human-in-the-loop","langgraph","nextjs","react","shadcn-ui","tailwindcss","tool-calling","typescript"],"demo":"https://agent-ui-kit-demo.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:07.120Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:07.120Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:07.120Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T23:43:07.120Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["React components for the hard parts of agentic products: watching an agent work, approving what it does, reviewing what it changed, and understanding what the run cost. For AI SDK 6 & 7 and AG-UI.","Typed against AI SDK 6 and 7 UIMessage parts (ai@^6.0.0 || ^7.0.102), runs on React 18 and 19 (react@^18.2.0 || ^19.0.0), and tested against each in CI. AG-UI agents (LangGraph, CrewAI, Mastra, Pydantic AI and the rest of the protocol's integrations) render through an adapter. Ships as an npm package with a precompiled stylesheet, and as a shadcn registry. Keyboard-first, screen-reader announced, and audited with axe in jsdom and in a real browser.","A full run in the playground, driven from the keyboard: Y approves the install, A/R review hunks, Ctrl+↵ applies."],"features":["What is it doing right now, and what already happened? Which calls ran, in what order, how long each took, which ones failed and why.","Should I let it do that? What exactly will run, how risky it is, and a fast, keyboard-friendly way to say yes, no, or no with a reason.","What did it change, and do I accept it? Hunk by hunk, not all or nothing, with the result fed back to the agent.","What did that cost? Tokens, cache efficiency, time to first token, and time actually spent working rather than waiting on you."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dgesteves/agent-ui-kit/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"91041aae2b754a3710e45bba47fd0a69f38832c9d6df814177de9930ea895c47","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:07.299Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:07.299Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"React components for the hard parts of agentic products: watching an agent work, approving what it does, reviewing what it changed, and understanding what the run cost. For AI SDK 6 & 7 and AG-UI.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dgesteves/agent-ui-kit/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"The quickstart, running is this section as an app, against a scripted model, so it needs no API key.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dgesteves/agent-ui-kit/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"91041aae2b754a3710e45bba47fd0a69f38832c9d6df814177de9930ea895c47","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dgesteves/agent-ui-kit/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:07.300Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T23:26:15Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dgesteves/agent-ui-kit/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:07.302Z","hash":"91041aae2b754a3710e45bba47fd0a69f38832c9d6df814177de9930ea895c47","originalBytes":51164,"storedBytes":51164,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["tool","run","import","message","text","agent-ui-kit","components","agent","sdk","app","approval","state","var","ag-ui","every","one","parts","pnpm","client","const","own","shadcn","call","error","file","tailwind","their","which","add","comm